{"3612950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Conflict of Interest", "steam_appid": 3612950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/01080e541a1f9a275501a04cf7c37ab3.avif?t=1770991820\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras_big/01080e541a1f9a275501a04cf7c37ab3.avif?t=1770991820 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Congratulations on your new employment opportunity with Enspirion! As our newest general specialist, you'll ensure Enspirion remains the world leader in energy, communications, and defense, and the name everyone has come to love and trust!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Michael Maddeson, Enspirion's newest hire... <strong><i>and greatest threat.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/46b31a7e979dc73286eeff890e54aa55.poster.avif?t=1770991820\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/46b31a7e979dc73286eeff890e54aa55.webm?t=1770991820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/46b31a7e979dc73286eeff890e54aa55.mp4?t=1770991820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Enspirion's newest fixer, help keep Enspirion running in its daily activities...<i> <strong>and expose their secrets to take control.</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep Enspirion's offices running smoothly and help other coworkers with their problems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost Enspirion's profits through day trading and earn a daily commision. Use your income to purchase weapons and equipment for your night job.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/867b36195d57e0ab8ab1a904c0494c9a.poster.avif?t=1770991820\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/867b36195d57e0ab8ab1a904c0494c9a.webm?t=1770991820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/867b36195d57e0ab8ab1a904c0494c9a.mp4?t=1770991820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work for Enspirion by day, installing, upgrading, and maintaining their security infrastructure...<i> <strong>and leave gaps for you to exploit during the night.</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install security cameras and hire employees to keep Enspirion running smoothly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of light and shadow to evade detection during the night. Use noise and other distractions to trick guards and take them hostage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/39b2a605a5729c2f61e3da7d6ace0ca3.poster.avif?t=1770991820\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/39b2a605a5729c2f61e3da7d6ace0ca3.webm?t=1770991820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/39b2a605a5729c2f61e3da7d6ace0ca3.mp4?t=1770991820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with your coworkers to learn their interests and grievances, and help them with their problems...<i> <strong>and turn them against Enspirion and each other.</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to employee requests and help them with their problems. Difficult problems sometimes call for unique solutions...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Act on their requests and grievances to learn crucial information.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/9dc3704a8f3559f52fdcc7ad67f469fa.poster.avif?t=1770991820\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/9dc3704a8f3559f52fdcc7ad67f469fa.webm?t=1770991820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/9dc3704a8f3559f52fdcc7ad67f469fa.mp4?t=1770991820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a bit closer with select employees and take them on dates...<i> <strong>and see what secrets they're really hiding.</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge good relationships with female employees to take them on dates at the end of the week.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different relationships can result in learning different information...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/bb6e25abfebaa6dfd3da259b254eeb56.poster.avif?t=1770991820\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/bb6e25abfebaa6dfd3da259b254eeb56.webm?t=1770991820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/bb6e25abfebaa6dfd3da259b254eeb56.mp4?t=1770991820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secret behind Enspirion... <strong><i>and the Commissars.</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter in a branching storyline with multiple options and endings available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One small decision can change everything...</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/01080e541a1f9a275501a04cf7c37ab3.avif?t=1770991820\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras_big/01080e541a1f9a275501a04cf7c37ab3.avif?t=1770991820 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Congratulations on your new employment opportunity with Enspirion! As our newest general specialist, you'll ensure Enspirion remains the world leader in energy, communications, and defense, and the name everyone has come to love and trust!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Michael Maddeson, Enspirion's newest hire... <strong><i>and greatest threat.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/46b31a7e979dc73286eeff890e54aa55.poster.avif?t=1770991820\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/46b31a7e979dc73286eeff890e54aa55.webm?t=1770991820\" type=\"v