 week.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different relationships can result in learning different information...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/bb6e25abfebaa6dfd3da259b254eeb56.poster.avif?t=1770991820\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/bb6e25abfebaa6dfd3da259b254eeb56.webm?t=1770991820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/extras/bb6e25abfebaa6dfd3da259b254eeb56.mp4?t=1770991820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secret behind Enspirion... <strong><i>and the Commissars.</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter in a branching storyline with multiple options and endings available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One small decision can change everything...</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Manage Enspirion Corporation's business and security by day while conducting espionage against it by night in stealth and action scenarios. Befriend and date employees to learn insider information. Discover the truth behind both of your employers.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/fbb7c92ab16ac5fd45a4fd9676c717c1ff6a2922/header.jpg?t=1770991820", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/22a3036bfc80d725cc1cf2d459178f335594b3f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770991820", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612950/22a3036bfc80d725cc1cf2d459178f335594b3f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1